message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "GEP_Evolution: simulation code for Kim & Pennell"
abstract: >-
  Strong-selection weak-mutation simulations of gene expression program
  evolution in which the number of task-specific phenotypes contributing
  jointly to fitness is varied between sequential (m = 1) and simultaneous
  (m = T) selection.
